{"t":"CF","made":"2026-11-14 00:19","name":"CF Industries Holdings, Inc.","ko":null,"sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Agricultural Inputs","employees":2900,"hq":"Northbrook, IL, United States","website":"https://www.cfindustries.com","summary_en":"CF Industries Holdings, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the production of ammonia in North America, Europe, and internationally. It operates through Ammonia, Granular Urea, UAN, AN, and Other segments. The company offers ammonia products; nitrogen products, such as granular urea, urea ammonium nitrate solution, and ammonium nitrate; diesel exhaust fluid, urea liquor, and nitric acid products. It serves cooperatives, retailers, independent fertilizer distributors, traders, wholesalers, and industrial users. The company was founded in 1946 and is headquartered in Northbrook, Illinois.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"CF Industries Holdings, Inc.는 자회사와 함께 북미, 유럽 및 국제적으로 암모니아 생산에 참여하고 있습니다. 암모니아, 과립 요소, UAN, AN 및 기타 부문을 통해 운영됩니다. 이 회사는 암모니아 제품을 제공합니다. 과립형 요소, 요소 질산암모늄 용액, 질산암모늄 등의 질소 제품; 디젤 배기 유체, 요소액 및 질산 제품. 협동조합, 소매업체, 독립 비료 유통업체, 무역업체, 도매업체 및 산업 사용자에게 서비스를 제공합니다. 이 회사는 1946년에 설립되었으며 일리노이주 노스브룩에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":124.68,"mcap":18238801920.0,"pe":8.7926655,"fpe":10.65611,"peg":0.5231,"ps":2.2970784,"pb":3.2348287,"ev_ebitda":5.626,"div":1.92,"beta":0.541,"hi52":141.96,"lo52":75.42},"fin":{"rev":7939999744.0,"rev_g":0.121,"eps_g":0.311,"gross":0.42519,"op":0.38489,"net":0.27481002,"roe":0.30855,"fcf":1589750016.0,"cash":2820000000.0,"debt":3656000000.0,"de":41.083,"eps":14.18,"feps":11.70033},"own":{"short":0.072,"inst":1.10793,"insider":0.00467},"analyst":{"n":20,"mean":129.636,"median":129.5,"high":195.72,"low":105.0,"rec":"hold","recMean":2.86364,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":2,"buy":3,"hold":14,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":2,"buy":3,"hold":14,"sell":2,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":3,"buy":3,"hold":13,"sell":2,"st